 Windows and macOS Subscription follow the approved account-card layout using their native controls: the account list is primary, with a separate refresh toolbar. Remaining percentages use the same readable type size as quota labels. Each known reset shows its absolute local time and the time remaining until that instant; an elapsed reset is pending refresh, not a negative duration. Countdown text updates locally while the page is active without making provider requests or rebuilding the page. Settings use restrained aligned rows and a source editor with All sources, its include-future-sources explanation, and individual source choices. All sources is persisted independently of the explicit selected-source list and disables the individual choices while enabled. The page has neither a diagnostics disclosure nor a credential-storage footer. Actual floating-panel failure messages remain visible.
 
